# Low Water, Act 1: places, districts, the night's events, hazards and Tide Runs. Director's file.
# The weather itself is the night schedule (design/PRODUCTION.md section 8; request R11). Events
# here set the flags and commands the script reads.

# Areas (walkable plates) are wired by the engineer once the plates' coordinates are known:
# quay (content/quay), brine (content/brine), weigh (content/weigh), lamp (content/lamp).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the night's events
@event ev.fog
at: 23:20
do: set(ev.fog)

@event ev.rain
at: 23:35
do: set(ev.rain)

@event ev.eave
at: 23:50
do: set(ev.eave_wet)

@event ev.drowned_covered
at: 23:52
do: set(ev.drowned_covered)

@event ev.midnight
at: 00:00
go: weigh.tube.midnight

@event ev.prov_travels
at: 00:20
do: set(ev.prov_travels)

@event ev.cells
at: 00:30
when: var.prov == wreckers
do: set(merrow.cells)

@event ev.gut_open
at: 00:40
do: set(gut.open)

@event ev.heavy_rain
at: 01:30
do: set(ev.heavy_rain); set(ev.soot_gone)

@event ev.crake_two
at: 02:00
do: set(ev.crake_two)

@event ev.rain_eases
at: 02:40
do: set(ev.rain_eases)

@event ev.appt_set
at: 00:25
if: var.prov == wreckers => appt = cells
if: var.prov == guild => appt = vote
if: var.prov == trust => appt = search
if: var.prov == keeper => appt = oven
if: var.prov == sea | var.prov == refused | var.prov == none => appt = keel

@event ev.appt_rumour
at: 01:00
do: set(appt.known)
nar: Item: the town has stopped looking at the quay lamps the way people look at lamps, and started looking at them the way people look at clocks.

@event ev.blackout
at: 02:50
camera: wide
cmd: setPower quay off
do: set(ev.blackout)
if: mother == burning => set(mother.out_again)

@event ev.blackout_near
at: 02:52
camera: near
do: set(ev.blackout_seen)

@event ev.blackout_ends
at: 03:20
cmd: setPower quay on
do: set(ev.blackout_ends)

@event ev.tin
at: 03:22
when: !seen(weigh.pip.tin) & (has(appt.stopped) | has(appt.joined) | has(appt.watched))
go: weigh.pip.tin

@event ev.frost
at: 04:10
do: set(ev.frost)

@event ev.hammer
at: 04:15
do: set(ev.hammer)

@event ev.hobb_runs
at: 04:25
when: var.tab_hobb == 1 & !has(hammer.keel) & !has(weigh.hammer_taken) & !at(weigh_out) & !at(weigh_in) & !at(office) & !at(tube)
nar: Somebody is running on the frost, badly, with two lights. It is Constant Hobb, a lantern in each hand, both swinging, so that he arrives inside a small private storm of shadows.
line: HOBB: Shelf. I'm not supposed to. The Sergeant says we don't come to people, people come to us. Only you did me a turn, and I'm doing you one, and then we're square, all right?
line: HOBB: The harbourmaster's had the hammer out of the weigh-house store. The lump hammer. Ten minutes since. He's gone up the mole with it, dripping, and the drips are freezing behind him like he's laying a path to come back by.
nar: He looks at the dark at the end of the mole the way he looks at all dark: as if it had his name.
line: HOBB: I'm going back to my lamp. I've told nobody this. Nobody's told me.
do: set(hammer.keel); quest(a1.frost, hammer); tab_hobb = 0

@event ev.keel_climbs
at: 04:30
do: set(ev.keel_climbs)

@event ev.lens
at: 04:55
when: !has(frost.met)
do: set(lens.broken); lens = broken

@event ev.high_water
at: 05:10
do: set(ev.high_water)

@event ev.crake_three
at: 05:30
do: set(ev.crake_three)

@event ev.dawn
at: 06:00
go: dawn.start

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- hazards (active only inside their runs; R10)
@hazard h.water
name: The flood
where: at(gully) | at(fish) | at(drowned)
when: tide > -0.35
every: 2
do: wet(0.1); meter(cold, 1)
warn: The water is coming back along the gully.
danger: min(1, (tide + 0.35) * 2)

@hazard h.frost
name: Frost
where: at(mole) | at(stairs)
when: frost > 0
every: 3
do: meter(cold, 1)
warn: The mole is white, and the white is slippery.
danger: 0.6

@hazard h.dark
name: The dark
where: at(quay) | at(weigh_out)
when: light < 0.05
every: 4
do: meter(dread, 1)
warn: The lamps are out. The edge of the quay is wherever it is.
danger: 0.5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tide Runs (R10)
@run r.gully
name: The gully back
area: floor
hazard: h.water
goal: steps
rate: 4
limit: 12
win: floor.run.gully.win
lose: floor.run.gully.lose
param: depth-loses waist

@run r.fish
name: Turning the fish
area: floor
hazard: h.water
goal: channel
rate: 4
limit: 8
win: floor.run.fish.win
lose: floor.run.fish.lose
param: helpers dilly

@run r.shadow
name: The Lamplighter's shadow
area: quay
hazard: h.dark
goal: office_window
rate: 4
limit: 10
win: weigh.run.shadow.win
lose: weigh.run.shadow.lose
param: pursuer hobb
param: sight 3

@run r.frost
name: Frost on the mole
area: lamp
hazard: h.frost
goal: lamproom
rate: 4
limit: 20
win: mole.run.frost.win
lose: mole.run.frost.lose
param: frost-ballast 6
param: climb 112

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the Lamps of Gullet: three lit
@event ev.lamps_three
at: 04:40
when: has(lamp.steps_post.lit) + has(lamp.porthole.lit) + has(lamp.gut.lit) + has(lamp.balance.lit) + has(lamp.drowned.lit) + has(mother.restruck) >= 3
do: quest(a1.lamps, three)
nar: Item: three lights in Gullet tonight that were dark when the assessor came off the ferry. The assessor did not come to light anything. The assessor came to say why it was dark.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- word comes to Lamb (signposts for the interrogations, 2026-10-17)
@event ev.word_merrow
at: 00:05
when: !has(merrow.cells) & !has(merrow.told) & !seen(brine.merrow.arrive) & !seen(brine.merrow.arrive.robbed) & !seen(brine.merrow.arrive.sunk)
go: word.merrow

@event ev.word_marrow
at: 00:50
when: !has(marrow.switch) & !has(afterdark.told)
go: word.marrow
